Dear all,

I hope you're all well.

I have a specific question related to theorical occupancy models. I'm wondering Is there any literature that specifies the minimum threshold naïve occupancy (proportion of occupied sites) required to develop single-species occupancy models effectively?. Any pointers or recommendations you can provide would be super helpful.

Thanks in advance for your time and consideration!

Best regards,

